<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!-- 地下設施洞口增援專用的兵力組成（DMS_HoleBase 的 groupKind），與派系一般的 Combat 分開，
       調整這裡不會影響任務、遺址與襲擊。組成寫在 DMS_Legacy 的 pawnGroupMakers（Faction_Hostile.xml）；
       沒有自己這張表的派系（例如 DMS_Army）借用它，見 DMS.AlertResponseUtility.TryChooseGroupMaker。
       Squad makeup used only by the underground facility's hole reinforcements (DMS_HoleBase's groupKind),
       kept apart from the faction's regular Combat so tuning it leaves quests, sites and raids alone.
       The options live in DMS_Legacy's pawnGroupMakers (Faction_Hostile.xml); factions without their own table
       (DMS_Army, for one) borrow it, see DMS.AlertResponseUtility.TryChooseGroupMaker. -->
  <PawnGroupKindDef>
    <defName>DMS_FacilityReinforcement</defName>
    <workerClass>PawnGroupKindWorker_Normal</workerClass>
  </PawnGroupKindDef>
</Defs>
